                                        "entry_id": "99976a72-e066-38b7-a310-dbe30d09476f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The period of the late fall and early winter when several holidays occur, such as Halloween, American Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year's Day, Hanukkah, and Kwanzaa"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US"
